      "<figure class=\"madas-excerpt\"><img src=\"resources/madas/alevel-pure-l/q10-solution-3.svg\" alt=\"Source correction. The printed ordinate at x = 8 is 35/29. Substituting x = 8 into the stated formula gives 35/28, consistent with the equally spaced x-values.\" style=\"--madas-width:638.7px\"></figure>",
